1. data/english-common.txt

A filtered subset (about 74,000 words) of the Debian "american-english"
(wamerican) word list, which is generated from SCOWL (Spell Checker
Oriented Word Lists) by Kevin Atkinson. Source: http://wordlist.aspell.net/

SCOWL notice (as understood; UNVERIFIED, verify with counsel):

    Copyright 2000-2018 by Kevin Atkinson

    Permission to use, copy, modify, distribute and sell these word lists,
