    documentation for any purpose is hereby granted without fee, provided
    that the above copyright notice appears in all copies and that both
    that copyright notice and this permission notice appear in supporting
    documentation. Kevin Atkinson makes no representations about the
    suitability of this array for any purpose. It is provided "as is"
    without express or implied warranty.

SCOWL itself aggregates other sources (for example Ispell, Moby, and
others), each with its own notice, which are reproduced in the full
SCOWL "Copyright" file and in /usr/share/doc/wamerican/copyright on
Debian systems. Those upstream notices have NOT been copied here; they
must be reviewed and added if the list is shipped as-is. The words in
the file have also been filtered and extended with project vocabulary
(tool and product names), which are the project's own additions.

